    \end{gather*}

Using $t\leq r-1$ and $\varsigma^{0}(t)\leq\varsigma^{0}(t+1)$ therefore gives
    \begin{gather} \mathbb{P}\Big[\mathcal{E}_{B}^{0,t+1}\Rightarrow\mathcal{D}^{t+1}\Big]
